		(property "Package" "XFL4020 family, 4.0 x 4.0 x 2.1 mm. 4.7 uH +/-20%, Isat 2 A, Irms 5 A, DCR 0.05 ohm max, AEC-Q200. Reuses the existing VERIFIED_VENDOR_EXACT AQROOT_Beta:Coilcraft_XFL4020 land pattern shared with L1 (XFL4020-152MEC). Within the TI 4.7-10 uH range; Isat is ~11x the calculated 181 mA peak, i.e. oversized, accepted to reuse a verified footprint and consolidate on one inductor family."
