		(property "Package" "Molex 5025700893 microSD push-push connector with independent mechanical card-detect switch. Pin 9 SHIELD is one logical pin on four physical shell lands. Pin 11 DETECT_LEVER is a second ground terminal per Molex Vss:GROUND. MECHANICAL CARD DETECT - ACTIVE LOW ON CARD INSERTION - NO BETA GPIO ALLOCATED - DO NOT ROUTE UNTIL PIN-MAP REVISION. CD/DAT3 (pin 2) is the SD data line used as SD_CS_N in SPI mode and is NOT the mechanical switch. DAT1/DAT2 unused in 1-bit mode."
