		(property "Note" "LOCAL VIN BYPASS for U17 TPS61169. Required by TI SNVSA40B section 7.5.1: the input capacitor must be close to the VIN pin and GND pin. C43 4.7uF is the power-stage input capacitor and sits 9.39 mm from U17 pin 5 - correct for the C43->L3 power loop (2.37 mm) but too far to bypass VIN. Added 2026-08-11 during the Routing Pass 1 blocker correction. Place immediately beside U17 VIN/GND; NOT ROUTED in this pass."
